<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><strong>3rd-4th March 2026<br />Carden Park, Cheshire</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><em><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Optional pre event activities on </span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Monday 2nd March from 15:00 - 18:00 - foot golf, vertigo, high ropes, zip wire, inflatable bag drop and golf driving range, followed by informal networking reception from </span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">18:30 - 22:30.</span></em></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><br />Join us for our 2026 Annual Conference &amp; Awards Ceremony at the prestigious Carden Park, Cheshire's leading country estate! We’ll bring together over 200 guests to connect, have fun and gain valuable insights from industry experts and peers on how to improve payment processes across the higher education ecosystem. During the conference you’ll hear the latest findings from our research initiatives and student payer experiences, as well as topical keynote sessions, panel discussions, best practices, product updates and more. You’ll also be part of our awards ceremony celebrating the achievements of the sector.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">There is no registration cost to attend this exclusive event - this event is free for Flywire clients. Limited subsidised accommodation is available for £99 per room, per night (details available upon registration).</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
