<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong style="background-color: transparent;">23rd June 2026</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><strong>Manchester Deansgate Hotel, Manchester</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><em>Optional pre event networking reception on Monday 22nd June from 18:30-22:30.</em></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Join us for the leading payment security and compliance event for the higher education sector. </span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Connect and collaborate with peers whilst staying up to date with the latest trends and gaining practical insights and key takeaways on payment security, AML and Fraud. </span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">The jam-packed agenda will include e</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">ngaging panel discussions, i</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">nteractive workshops, i</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">nsightful presentations from industry experts and peers in the education sector, and much more.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">There is no registration cost to attend this exclusive event - this event is free for Flywire clients. Limited subsidised accommodation is available for £99 per room, per night (details available upon registration).</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
