<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">These interactive meetings bring together institutions to discuss the latest trends, hot topics, raise questions and share their own best practices. Please click on the relevant date to register. </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">AML Community Meetings</span></strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Join Flywire for interactive and engaging sessions focusing on Fraud and AML in Higher Education. The aim of these community meetings is for you to share your experiences and best practice with other community members. Part of these meetings will have a presentation from either Flywire, or an external speaker on an issue that will interest the audience.<br />‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/8320zHQLR3uslZhm4VVIpw?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>20th January</u></strong></span></a><strong> | </strong><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/SXXq0UDwR0OzNHdF3LFbIw?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>21st April </u></strong></span></a><strong>| </strong>13th October (registration not yet available)<br /><br /></span><u></u></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><strong><br /><span style="color: #0f476b;">Tribal Community Meetings</span></strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Join Flywire's Tribal Community Meetings hosted by Oliver Mussett, Flywire's Senior Strategic Partner Manager who oversees Flywire's partnership with Tribal. <br /><em>More dates to be added in due course.</em><strong><br /><br /></strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJcpd-2trzwrHtUdCZsYBO_ScUYfxbx5w05o?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>15th January</u></strong></span></a><br />‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><strong><br /><span style="color: #0f476b;">Payment Security Community Meetings</span></strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Join the Payment Security Community Meetings hosted by Dave Neild, Lead Security Consultant to hear the latest insights from the Payment Security team. Each meeting will focus on a hot topic.<strong><br /></strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/zlJAabG8TySqlMaW4oLqBA?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>25th March</u></strong></span></a> |&nbsp; <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/Z0ThGRS_TIqZLqD53V9_Ng?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>28th October</u></strong></span></a>&nbsp; |&nbsp; 16th December (registration not yet available)<br /><br />‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>Monthly QSA drop-in calls</strong></span> <br />These calls provide you with the unique opportunity to ask our Qualified Security Assessors questions, every third Wednesday of the month, from 12:30 - 13:30. You can register for individual calls or you can add the full series to your calendar and drop in as required.<br />‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.addevent.com/event/w5shrbw8xchn?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>21st January</u></strong></span></a> |&nbsp; <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://evt.to/1kb9tzgb1byk?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>18th February</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.addevent.com/event/mjlvf8t804x0?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>18th March</u></strong></span></a>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <a href="https://www.addevent.com/event/927k4970mvyq?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=" style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>15th April&nbsp;</u></strong></span></a><br />‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.addevent.com/event/wk9v79dxwf7p?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Add all to calendar&nbsp;</u></strong></span></a></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> </td> 
</tr> 
