<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Due to the continued success of this program over many years, we are once again offering our free, sector-focused training courses for 2026. We urge you to leverage these valuable resources, and if you've already attended, please pass this email along to team members who could benefit.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><strong>AML &amp; Fraud Foundation Training - 1 day course</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Our fraud and anti-money laundering (AML) training is aimed at those responsible for AML. The course will introduce fraud and money laundering concepts; consider the legal position as it applies to the sector; summarise the known activity in the sector; provide guidance to help assess and mitigate risk; outline frameworks to identify and analyse suspicious activity; and provide reporting guidance both internally and to the National Crime Agency. Register for our upcoming courses below.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://web.cvent.com/event/23542699-9b67-4979-9877-7c2e9ca6bb8a/regProcessStep1?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>17th March</u></strong></span></a> | <a href="https://web.cvent.com/event/7c07139e-82c6-4e64-8c99-9991891dd1fc/regProcessStep1?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=" style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>2nd June</u></strong></span></a> |&nbsp; 6th October and 15th December (registration not yet available)</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><strong>Payment Security Foundation - 1 day course</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">The training provides an overview of payment security and PCI DSS requirements, including DPA/GDPR obligations. The training also covers key activities which must be undertaken irrespective of your scope, including development and dissemination of Information Security Policies, annual risk assessments, incident response planning/testing, and cardholder data discovery.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Aimed at those individuals who are in management roles,</span> leading or implementing their institutions Payment Security Management Program. Register for our upcoming courses below.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://web.cvent.com/event/220c3413-cb27-40bc-ab21-2fa10688c2c9/regProcessStep1?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>24th February&nbsp;</u></strong></span></a> | <a href="https://web.cvent.com/event/d7b660a3-23b0-42ef-816d-1df111ca624f/regProcessStep1?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=" style="color: #223341;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>28th April&nbsp;</u></strong></span></a> |&nbsp; 22nd September and 17th November (registration not yet available)<br />‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><strong>Payment Security Practitioner - 2 day course</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><br /><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Aimed at team members who will have responsibility for managing 'payment security' in their organisation</span>, but may also be useful for IT staff or internal auditors who will have an involvement in implementing/maintaining controls or auditing (PCI DSS compliance).</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">This training course builds on the Payment Security Foundation course (<span style="text-decoration: underline;">we would ask that you attend Foundation first)</span> and explores areas relevant to the needs of the sector in more detail to help you implement and manage more effective approaches to managing payment security and PCI DSS compliance.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://web.cvent.com/event/70237141-1d4a-4cc7-8ccc-acbbe74c0d21/regProcessStep1?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>12th - 13th May</u></strong></span></a></span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
